{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.symbolic_character_table","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.symbolic_character_table","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SytSmallShapeCounts","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SytSmallShapeCountsLarger"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_adjacent_eq_triple_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_adjacent_eq_triple_sq","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L140-L145","doc":"**Adjacent-pair character is the square of the triple character**:\n`χ(σᵢσ_{i+1}) = χ(σᵢσ_{i+1}σ_{i+2})²` (both `h²`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_pair_commutation_defect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_pair_commutation_defect","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L131-L137","doc":"**Commutation defect**: the adjacent-pair and far-commuting-pair characters of\n`[3,1,1]` differ by exactly `2` — the braid-relation contribution lost when the\ngenerators commute. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_triple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_triple","kind":"def","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L127-L128","doc":"Manuscript triple character: `χ_{[3,1,1]}(σᵢσ_{i+1}σ_{i+2}) = −h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_farPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_farPair","kind":"def","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L123-L125","doc":"Manuscript far-commuting-pair character (`|i − j| ≥ 2`):\n`χ_{[3,1,1]}(σᵢσⱼ) = h² − 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_adjacentPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi311_adjacentPair","kind":"def","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L120-L121","doc":"Manuscript adjacent-pair character: `χ_{[3,1,1]}(σᵢσ_{i+1}) = h²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.symbolic_character_table","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.symbolic_character_table","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L88-L113","doc":"**Self-conjugate single-generator character factorisation**\n([`prop:symbolic-character-table`]): `χ_λ(σ₁) = c_λ · h` for every self-conjugate\npartition `λ`, proved concretely (`sorry`-free). The character is the σ₁\nseminormal character `sigmaOneCharacter`; the factorisation follows from\n`|R_row| = |R_col|` (`sigmaOneCharacter_eq_card_mul`) and the per-shape counts\n`|R_row| = c_λ`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:symbolic-character-table","label":"prop:symbolic-character-table","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/symbolic-character-table.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.card_rowClass_shapeOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.card_rowClass_shapeOf","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L78-L86","doc":"**`|R_row|(shapeOf λ) = c_λ`** — the same-row class count of each tabulated shape\nis its coefficient `{1, 3, 8, 10}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chiSigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chiSigma","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L72-L76","doc":"**The concrete σ₁ seminormal character** of the self-conjugate shape (purely\ndiagonal — the off-diagonal class is empty for the single generator). Replaces\nthe former opaque class field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.shapeOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.shapeOf","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L65-L70","doc":"The self-conjugate Young diagram of each tabulated partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.cCoefficient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.cCoefficient","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L57-L63","doc":"The `c_λ` coefficient for each self-conjugate partition: integer valued,\n`c_λ = #SYT(λ)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprSelfConjugatePartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprSelfConjugatePartition","kind":"instance","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprSelfConjugatePartition.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprSelfConjugatePartition.repr","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqSelfConjugatePartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqSelfConjugatePartition","kind":"instance","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p4111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p4111","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p321","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p321","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p311","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p311","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition.p21","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SelfConjugatePartition","kind":"inductive","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/symbolic_character_table.lean#L49-L55","doc":"The four self-conjugate partition labels recorded in the table. ","signatureChunk":0}]}